This repository is released under two licenses, by path. Full, unmodified
license texts: `LICENSES/MIT.txt`, `LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`.

MIT License (`LICENSES/MIT.txt`) — the operative Teamcell Lite Cell package:
  distribution/            (the installable kit, its manifest, and the
                             optional-package source material it contains)
  scripts/                 (the six installer tools)
  schemas/                 (all field-contract schemas in this repository)

  Also embedded, for every installed Cell: distribution/teamcell-lite/
  bootstrap-kit/LICENSE carries the same MIT text and ships at the root of
  every Cell created from this kit (baseline package, always installed).

  Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Bieber. Commercial and closed-source reuse is
  permitted; there is no obligation to contribute changes back.

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (`LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`) —
existing explanatory documentation and teaching examples, unchanged by this
decision:
  docs/
  templates/
  examples/
  README.md
  CONTRIBUTING.md
  CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
  SECURITY.md
  SUPPORT.md

reports/ (release verification reports) is MIT — see the per-file mapping in
distribution/teamcell-lite/SOURCE-MANIFEST.json and
reports/verification/PUBLIC-CELL-RELEASE.md, which restate this table for
every file this release adds or changes.

Third-party content, if any is added to this repository in the future,
carries its own license and notice and is not covered by either license
above; none is known to be present in this release. This scope replaces the
prior single-license CC BY 4.0 LICENSE file, whose text now lives unchanged
at LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt — no CC BY-licensed file's license has changed;
this decision only adds MIT for the previously unlicensed and newly added
operative-package paths above.

